WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.310
- New in theaters this weekend:

00:00:01.310 --> 00:00:03.430
Countdown and Black and Blue.

00:00:03.430 --> 00:00:04.440
What will you see?

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:06.403
This is your Weekend Ticket.

00:00:06.403 --> 00:00:09.070
(driving music)

00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:13.920
- Whatever's happening to us,

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:17.040
I think it's because of this app.

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:17.900
We need a new phone.

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.923
New phone, new number, new service.

00:00:20.824 --> 00:00:22.824
(sighs)

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:24.960
- [??] Anything else I can help you with?

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:25.793
- No.

00:00:26.873 --> 00:00:28.161
(phone chimes)

00:00:28.161 --> 00:00:31.078
(unsettling music)

00:00:39.544 --> 00:00:40.377
(screams)

00:00:40.377 --> 00:00:42.840
- The horror movie Countdown
comes out this weekend.

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:45.930
When Quinn downloads the new
trendy app named Countdown

00:00:45.930 --> 00:00:48.290
that tells you how long
you have before you die,

00:00:48.290 --> 00:00:51.560
it reveals she has just
short of three days.

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:54.970
Now she's in a panic race to
find out if the app is fake

00:00:54.970 --> 00:00:57.880
or if she has only days to live.

00:00:57.880 --> 00:01:00.430
This movie's for you if
a suspense horror film

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:01.830
sounds good this weekend,

00:01:01.830 --> 00:01:03.220
you're a fan of Twilight Zone-

00:01:03.220 --> 00:01:05.110
or Black Mirror-type premises,

00:01:05.110 --> 00:01:07.930
or you're ready to have
a fun weekend in 10...

00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:09.870
Nine...

00:01:11.010 --> 00:01:12.570
Eight...

00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:14.360
Seven- you get it.

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:15.600
- I gotta meet a CI.

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:16.520
Oh whoa, whoa, whoa, where you going?

00:01:16.520 --> 00:01:17.353
Stay in the car.

00:01:18.834 --> 00:01:21.270
(gun fires)

00:01:21.270 --> 00:01:23.938
- Listen, you already got rid
of everyone that could talk.

00:01:23.938 --> 00:01:26.271
(gun fires)

00:01:27.610 --> 00:01:28.741
- The hell are you doing here, rookie?

00:01:28.741 --> 00:01:30.180
- Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa,
whoa, whoa! Just relax!

00:01:30.180 --> 00:01:31.030
- [Off Screen] We're all cops here.

00:01:31.030 --> 00:01:32.082
- This isn't what it looks like.

00:01:32.082 --> 00:01:33.858
(gun fires rapidly)

00:01:33.858 --> 00:01:35.841
(crash)

00:01:35.841 --> 00:01:36.674
- [Off Screen] What the hell did you do?

00:01:36.674 --> 00:01:38.482
- She had a body cam on!

00:01:38.482 --> 00:01:39.890
(gasps)

00:01:39.890 --> 00:01:42.315
But we got a ghost! She's gone!

00:01:42.315 --> 00:01:43.148
- Find her!

00:01:43.148 --> 00:01:45.150
- Black and Blue comes out this weekend.

00:01:45.150 --> 00:01:49.000
When a rookie cop catches a
shady deal that ends in murder

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:50.520
on her police body cam,

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:53.060
she's shot, but escapes,
and is now on the run

00:01:53.060 --> 00:01:54.940
from the people who tried to kill her,

00:01:54.940 --> 00:01:57.954
both criminals and crooked cops.

00:01:57.954 --> 00:01:58.910
(gasps)

00:01:58.910 --> 00:02:00.610
This movie is for you
if you're looking for

00:02:00.610 --> 00:02:02.440
an intense action this weekend,

00:02:02.440 --> 00:02:04.460
you're a fan of movies like Training Day,

00:02:04.460 --> 00:02:06.820
or you didn't know this
whole show is recorded

00:02:06.820 --> 00:02:08.090
on a head cam.

00:02:08.090 --> 00:02:09.590
Isn't that right, camerawoman?

00:02:12.350 --> 00:02:13.750
Nice. You're a little stiff.

00:02:15.748 --> 00:02:16.581
Your neck.

00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:19.390
That is your Weekend Ticket!

00:02:19.390 --> 00:02:20.230
What will you see?

00:02:20.230 --> 00:02:22.280
And check back next
week if you'll be back,

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:23.890
read in a Terminator impression.

00:02:23.890 --> 00:02:25.310
Oh, I was supposed to say it!

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:26.270
You'll be back.

00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:27.103
There we go.

